			<zone xml:id="p4z6-0" points="1740,1852 1825,1847 1903,1871 2048,1841 2077,1858 2164,1862 2164,1781 2025,1802 1976,1767 1928,1772 1895,1796 1862,1780 1791,1793 1740,1773">1748,1841 1774,1837 1800,1836 1826,1835 1852,1835 1878,1837 1904,1837 1930,1834 1957,1832 1983,1832 2009,1832 2035,1832 2061,1832 2087,1832 2113,1832 2139,1834 2166,1838</zone>
